Good Morning Perry,

Here are the updated placement and internship reports for your programs from =
the past week.

The first excel sheet tab contains the placement totals for the entire Class =
of 2027. Each sheet after that contains data for your program or programs.
The sheets include a 'Most Recent Friday' table, which shows the data as of t=
he day and time you received this email.
There is also a 'Weekly History' table, which provides a picture of how the p=
lacement numbers have been changing over the past couple of months.
Each table shows how many students are in each placement category. The most i=
mportant categories are bolded. At the bottom of each table, you can see the =
placement percentage
The placement details sheet gives details about the specific student's who pl=
aced in the last week, Full-Time and Internship

If you have any questions, please contact the BCC Data Team. If there are any=
 discrepancies in the data, please let us know.

Sincerely,
BCC Data Team

